# Allowlist: nothing goes into the image unless it is named here: the app, the
# project code, the rule tables and the deployed model file. Tests, docs, data,
# git metadata and any local virtual environment stay out.
*
!app/
!src/
!rules/
!models/phase3/c2/model.json

# ...and nothing inside those that the app does not run.
app/tests/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pdf
